# GitHub 上传用：统一换行与字符集，避免中文文件名在某些系统上显示成乱码
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.docx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
